  "description": "OpenAI-compatible bring-your-own-key adapter for Tamp.Conformance. One thin IChatCompletion shim over the /chat/completions API that, via a base-URL override, covers OpenAI, Azure OpenAI, Poolside, and any self-hosted / air-gapped OpenAI-compatible endpoint (vLLM, Ollama). Auth header is configurable (Bearer or api-key). The key is read from the environment and never emitted.",
